    383
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "केचित्तु होरां प्रथमां भपस्य वाञ्छन्ति लाभाधिपतेर्द्वितीयाम्।",
   "bbox": [
    321,
    395,
    1160,
    475
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "द्रेष्काणसंज्ञामपि वर्णयन्ति स्वद्वादशैकादशराशिपानाम्।। 12 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    324,
    457,
    1223,
    538
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Some Acharyas define Hora as the Lord of the same sign",
   "bbox": [
    330,
    543,
    1466,
    625
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "for the first half and the lord of the 11th from that sign as that",
   "bbox": [
    254,
    596,
    1469,
    678
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of the 2nd half. Similarly some take the decante lords as the",
   "bbox": [
    257,
    649,
    1469,
    731
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "lord of the sign, the lord of the 12th from the sign and the lord",
   "bbox": [
    257,
    700,
    1472,
    785
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of the 11th from the sign respectively. (But such a definition is",
   "bbox": [
    260,
    753,
    1473,
    837
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "not generally accepted).",
   "bbox": [
    262,
    831,
    736,
    886
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<b>Exaltation and Debilitation of Planets</b>",
   "bbox": [
    266,
    915,
    1258,
    989
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "अजवृषभमृगाङ्गनाकुलीरा झषवणिजौ च दिवाकरादितुङ्गाः।",
   "bbox": [
    338,
    998,
    1171,
    1078
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "दशशिखिमनुयुक्तिथीन्द्रियांशैस्त्रिनवकविंशतिभिश्च तेऽस्तनीचा:।। 13।।",
   "bbox": [
    341,
    1052,
    1351,
    1145
   ]
  },
